OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy and mostly dry through the
OL,7,Fevening with clear spells. Clouding
OL,8,Fover through the night with patchy
OL,9,Frain developing. Fresh to strong
OL,10,Fwinds, particularly around the coast.
OL,11,FFeeling rather cool.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FGenerally cloudy with
OL,14,Fpatchy light rain across the region.
OL,15,FModerate to fresh winds initially but
OL,16,Feasing through the day. Feeling mild
OL,17,Fin the south but cooler around the
OL,18,Fcoasts.
